    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I get that it's \"designed\" with layers, but people are still pointing out specific gaps, like how hard it is to verify signatures or the risk of ballots being intercepted. If those things are actually possible, isn't it misleading to just say we should \"trust the process\"?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
